    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d180-a1">

                <pb facs="0345" n="229" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg229"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Diplomatic Circular No. 67.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 7, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>With reference to Circular No. 58 of June 19, the Dean has the honor to submit
                    herewith for the approval of his Honorable Colleagues the draft of a Note to the
                    Wai Chiao Pu reminding the Chinese Government that the Diplomatic Body cannot
                    recognize the levy of the Stamp Tax on foreigners.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
